  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "羅雀咖啡館。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7F8596C0549655619928300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "店如其名，\n咖啡館還是門可羅雀比較好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E9759825176540DFF0C000A5496556199289084662F958053EF7F8596C06BD48F03597D300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這間咖啡館過去也曾因為\n客人增加太多而應接不暇……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90199593549655619928904E53BB4E5F66FE56E070BA000A5BA24EBA589E52A0592A591A800C61C963A54E0D66872026202600100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一旦忙過頭，\n人就會變得麻木，所以我受不了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0065E65FD9904E982DFF0C000A4EBA5C3167038B8A5F979EBB6728FF0C62404EE5621153D74E0D4E862026202600100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話雖如此，要是沒客人上門，店就會倒閉。\n這當中的分寸真難拿捏……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A7196D659826B64FF0C8981662F6C925BA24EBA4E0A9580FF0C5E975C316703501295893002000A901975764E2D768452065BF8771F96E362FF634F2026202600100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳明白我的意思了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3660E767D62117684610F601D4E865427FF1F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "完全不明白",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8C51684E0D660E767D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我又不是超能力者",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153C84E0D662F8D8580FD529B80050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "簡單來說，我希望開發出一種餐點，\n能吸引足夠的客人讓這間店不會倒閉，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但又不至於變忙。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C2155AE4F868AAAFF0C62115E0C671B958B767C51FA4E007A2E99109EDEFF0C000A80FD54385F158DB3592076845BA24EBA8B93901995935E974E0D670350129589FF0C00100001BE00000A4F4653C84E0D81F365BC8B8A5FD9300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道什麼樣的餐點比較好呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E590534EC09EBC6A23768499109EDE6BD48F03597D5462FF1F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷格雷派餅",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E99050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可頌",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF980C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咖哩飯",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549654E998EF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷格雷派餅不管在哪裡推出，\n都還是密阿雷格雷派餅，所以我受不了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E99054E0D7BA1572854EA88E163A851FAFF0C000A90FD9084662F5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E9905FF0C62404EE5621153D74E0D4E86300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "比不過新咖啡的可頌，\n這我受不了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD44E0D904E65B054965561768453EF980CFF0C000A9019621153D74E0D4E86300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "旅館Z的咖哩意外地很好吃，\n被拿去相比的話，我會受不了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65C59928005A7684549654E9610F591657305F88597D5403FF0C000A88AB62FF53BB76F86BD476848A71FF0C6211670353D74E0D4E86300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "壽司……<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳覺得如何？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "58FD53F82026202600100003110000FF01014F6059B389BA5F9759824F55FF1F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然是輕食沒錯，\n但跟咖啡不搭……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n正是能多多少少吸引客人上門的餐點。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136662F8F1598DF6C92932FFF0C000A4F468DDF549655614E0D642D2026202600100001BE00000A6B63662F80FD591A591A5C115C1154385F155BA24EBA4E0A9580768499109EDE300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "連我都覺得是個好點子！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9023621190FD89BA5F97662F500B597D9EDE5B50FF0100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過我根本沒做過壽司啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E62116839672C6C92505A904E58FD53F8554A300200100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在回轉夢想家吃要花錢，\n所以我受不了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這樣<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳明白我的意思了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572856DE8F49592260F35BB65403898182B19322FF0C000A62404EE5621153D74E0D4E86FF0100100001BE00000A90196A2300100003110000FF01014F6059B3660E767D62117684610F601D4E865427FF1F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
